<title>FINLAND: FINVEST HAS 19.2 OF SUOMEN OPTIOPORSSI.</title>
<headline>FINVEST HAS 19.2 OF SUOMEN OPTIOPORSSI.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish consulting and capacitor group Finvest Oy said on Wednesday it had acquired 19.2 percent of Suomen Optioporssi Oy for 20 markka per share.</p>
<p>&quot;Finvest invests in Suomen Optioporssi's shares because it believes the soon-to-be started pulp bourse will open up interesting possibilities,&quot; Finvest said in a statement.</p>
<p>Finnish options exchange Suomen optioporssi said earlier this week that trade in its pulp derivatives would start on February 4.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
